"""
ATB BI PROJECT - MASTER PRODUCTION PIPELINE
============================================

Complete end-to-end orchestration of ETL, transformation, ML training, and serving.

Pipeline Stages:
1. Data Ingestion → Airbyte syncs raw data to ODS layer
2. ODS Validation → Check row counts and data freshness
3. dbt Transformation → Build staging, intermediate, warehouse layers
4. Warehouse Validation → Confirm facts/dimensions loaded correctly
5. ML Feature Engineering → Query PFE_DWH and build feature matrices
6. ML Model Training → Train XGBoost and Random Forest on risk classification
7. Model Evaluation → SHAP explanations, ROC/PR curves, performance metrics
8. Model Registry → Register best model (MLflow or pickle)
9. Batch Prediction → Score all customers with latest model
10. Model Monitoring → Track drift, performance, and data quality metrics
11. Alerts & Reporting → Send notifications, update dashboards

Schedule: Daily at 02:00 UTC
Retries: 2 with 5-min backoff
Max Parallel Tasks: 8
"""

